# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files, regardless of OS or local
# git config (core.autocrlf). Prevents Windows checkouts from introducing CRLF,
# which conflicts with the LF requirement in .editorconfig and breaks
# `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` on windows-latest CI runners.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.snk binary
*.pfx binary
